  "details": "Basically the title, but to make it a bit more clear, being able to open a new world that is Android compatible as either PC only or both, through maybe a toggle when opening. And why not have the option to open as Android only also. It is very niche, but I think it would solve a problem a lot of PC users have, I have heard from friends and experienced myself increased levels of immaturity and trolling on Android compatible worlds, and avoid opening or going to public instances of them. This seems like it could potentially be a simple solution.",
